---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Feels Like Om</title>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="hero">
  <div class="overlay"></div>

  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Who you are matters.</h1>
    <p>
      Slow down. Listen to the land.
      Make space for yourself.
    </p>
  </div>
</main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Georgia, serif;
    background: #f4efe5;
    color: white;
  }

  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: 2rem;
    background:
      url('/hero-river.JPG')
      center / cover
      no-repeat;
  }

  .overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to top,
      rgba(15, 25, 17, 0.72),
      rgba(15, 25, 17, 0.05) 65%
    );
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 42rem;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  h1 {
  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 7rem);
  line-height: 0.95;
  margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  h1 {
    white-space: normal;
  }
}

  p {
    max-width: 34rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 4rem;
    }
  }
</style>